{"words": [{"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "Those"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "(are) the ones who"}, {"text": "ٱشْتَرَوُا۟", "translation": "bought"}, {"text": "ٱلضَّلَـٰلَةَ", "translation": "[the] astraying"}, {"text": "بِٱلْهُدَىٰ", "translation": "for [the] guidance"}, {"text": "فَمَا", "translation": "So not"}, {"text": "رَبِحَت", "translation": "profited"}, {"text": "تِّجَـٰرَتُهُمْ", "translation": "their commerce"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "translation": "were they"}, {"text": "مُهْتَدِينَ", "translation": "guided-ones"}], "sahih": "Those are the ones who have purchased error [in exchange] for guidance, so their transaction has brought no profit, nor were they guided."}